{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not delay JVM-fatal failures behind arbitrary cleanup.** After an end hook throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, this continues running every remaining plugin; any later hook can block indefinitely and prevent the fatal condition from escaping. Rethrow JVM-fatal errors immediately, or place subsequent best-effort cleanup behind a strict time bound.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77yjQZ","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":114,"observation_digest":"732598f91af01ca1022e116fe7bb259bcba383191202d1da4497991658a83c33","observation_id":"aro_v1_omszr6i26aokcarocfx6pozftp","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:30:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_povxmdcloccfgct74pwuugcyxz","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"18d4e3c9937570ae7a3618bb4830be440021e816","reviewer":"codex","start_line":114,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_kox4bagp4swc77jdthcfqzcwgq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:30:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
